\newlabel{tab:gpqa_ds_random}{{4}{5}{DeepSeek GPQA Diamond: Random eviction phase gradient. Unlike MATH-500 where random eviction produces null gradients at low sparsity, GPQA random eviction shows significant phase-dependent severity at all tested levels}{table.4}{}}
